# AI-harness per-checkout runtime state (ruflo / claude-flow / gstack).
#
# All of this is already in .gitignore, but prettier does NOT read .gitignore —
# it reads this file only. Without these entries `pnpm turbo format-check` fails
# locally for anyone who has run the harness, while CI's clean checkout stays
# green. The local gate is then red for reasons the developer did not cause,
# exactly when it is most useful: before pushing.
#
# Depth matters. These are written at whatever directory the tool runs from
# (ruvnet/ruflo#695); this checkout carries them at the repo root, under
# .claude/hooks/ and under packages/worker/. Bare directory names are already
# unanchored, but any pattern containing a slash is anchored to this file's
# directory, so those need an explicit `**/`.
.claude-flow/
.swarm/
.hive-mind/
.gstack/
claude-flow.config.json
claude-flow.db
ruvector.db
agentdb.rvf*
hive-mind-prompt-*.txt
**/.claude/checkpoints/
**/.claude/helpers/
**/.claude/security-scans/
**/.claude/proven-config.json
**/.claude/.proven-config-version
**/.claude/.harness/
**/.claude/settings.json.bak
**/.claude/*.local.md

# Audit output written by the security-audit / harness-audit skills.
reports/security_audit.*
reports/harness_audit.*
reports/.artifacts/
reports/.history/